    h1 Brain Fog
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.webmd.com/brain/ss/slideshow-brain-fog") WebMD]:
    blockquote “Brain fog” isn’t a medical condition. It’s a term used for certain symptoms that can affect your ability to think. You may feel confused or disorganized or find it hard to focus or put your thoughts into words.

